  "title": "Unified title",
  "summary": "Large Audio Language Models (LALMs) face challenges in measuring fairness across demographic subgroups due to confounding factors like semantic variation and speaker-specific characteristics. A semantic-aware mixed-effects regression framework is introduced to account for these factors, improving fairness estimation while maintaining model performance.",
